{"source":"###Pure\nClass test::Employee\n{\n   id: Integer[1];\n   managerId: Integer[0..1];\n   name: String[1];\n}\n\nAssociation test::Employee_Manager\n{\n   reports: test::Employee[*];\n   manager: test::Employee[0..1];\n}\n\n###Mapping\nMapping test::selfJoinMapping\n(\n   test::Employee[e]: Pure {\n      ~src test::Employee\n      id: $src.id,\n      managerId: $src.managerId,\n      name: $src.name\n   }\n\n   test::Employee_Manager: ModelJoin {\n      {manager:test::Employee[1], reports:test::Employee[1]|$reports.managerId == $manager.id}\n   }\n)\n","kind":"compile","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.compiler.test.fromGrammar.TestMappingCompilationFromGrammar#testModelJoinSelfAssociation"}
