{"source":"###Pure\nClass test::Person\n{\n   name: String[1];\n}\n\nClass test::Firm\n{\n   id: Integer[1];\n   legalName: String[1];\n}\n\nAssociation test::Firm_Person\n{\n   employees: test::Person[*];\n   employer: test::Firm[1];\n}\n\n\n###Mapping\nMapping test::modelJoinMapping\n(\n   test::Person[p]: Pure {\n      ~src test::Person\n      +firmId: Integer[1]: 1,\n      name: $src.name\n   }\n   \n   test::Firm[f]: Pure {\n      ~src test::Firm\n      id: $src.id,\n      legalName: $src.legalName\n   }\n\n   test::Firm_Person: ModelJoin {\n      {employer, employees|$employer.id == $employees.firmId}\n   }\n)\n","kind":"compile","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.compiler.test.fromGrammar.TestMappingCompilationFromGrammar#testModelJoinAssociationMapping"}
