{"source":"###Relational\nDatabase sample::test\n(\n  View SomeView\n  (\n    prefix: case(\n              tab.val = 20, 1,\n              tab.val != 20, 1,\n              tab.val < 20, 1,\n              tab.val > 20, 1,\n              tab.val <= 20, 1,\n              tab.val >= 20, 1,\n              tab.val <> 20, 1,\n              tab.val is null, 1,\n              tab.val is not null, 1,\n              tab.val and tab.val, 1,\n              tab.val and tab.val or tab.val, 1,\n              tab.val > 20 and tab.val < 100, 1,\n              tab.val > 20 or tab.val <= 100, 1,\n              (tab.val > 20 and tab.val <= 100) or tab.val <> 2, 1,\n              substring(tab.val) > 100, 1,\n              sqlNull()\n            ) > 2\n  )\n  Join Abe([test::TEST_DB2]a.col1 > 2 and [test::TEST_DB2]b.col1 > 3 or [test::TEST_DB2]b.col1 > 4)\n)\n","kind":"roundtrip-unformatted","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.grammar.test.TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testRelationalOperations"}
{"source":"###Mapping\nMapping test::mapping\n(\n  CM1: Relational\n  {\n    name: [TEST_SCOPE]TEST.another.stateProvNameTXT,\n    subdivisionCategory: if(equal(substring([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.another.stateProv, 1, 2), 'US'), 'STATE', sqlNull()),\n    code: [TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.nodeCODE,\n    scheme: [TEST_SCOPE]@join_1,\n    parent: [TEST_SCOPE]@join_2,\n    hierarchyLevel: case(equal([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.test_val, 20), 1, equal([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.test_val, 30), 2, equal([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.test_val, 40), 3, equal([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.test_val, 55), 4, equal([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.test_val, 60), 5, sqlNull()),\n    prop1: divide(if(equal([TEST_DB2]@join_1 > (OUTER) [TEST_DB2]@join_2 | toString([TEST_DB2]SOMETHING.something.toValue), '0903'), 0.0, [TEST_DB2]@join_3 > (INNER) [TEST_DB2]@join_4 | parseFloat([TEST_DB2]schema1.table2.col3)), if(isEmpty([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.factor), 1.0, divide(1, [TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something.factor))),\n    part[part_TEST]: [TEST_SCOPE]@join_1 > [TEST_SCOPE]@join_2,\n    prop1: divide(if(equal([TEST_DB2]@join_1 > (OUTER) [TEST_DB2]@join_2 | toString([TEST_DB2]SOMETHING.something.toValue), '0903'), 0.0, [TEST_DB2]@join_3 > (INNER) [TEST_DB2]@join_4 | parseFloat([TEST_DB2]schema1.table2.col3)), if(isEmpty(table.factor), 1.0, divide(1, table.factor)))\n  }\n)\n","kind":"roundtrip-format","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.grammar.test.TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testRelationalMappingScope"}
{"source":"###Mapping\nMapping test::mapping\n(\n  CM1: Relational\n  {\n    scope([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.another)\n    (\n      name: stateProvNameTXT,\n      subdivisionCategory: if(equal(substring(stateProv, 1, 2), 'US'), 'STATE', sqlNull())\n    ),\n    scope([TEST_SCOPE]TEST.something)\n    (\n      code: nodeCODE,\n      scheme: @join_1,\n      parent: @join_2,\n      hierarchyLevel: case(equal(test_val, 20), 1, equal(test_val, 30), 2, equal(test_val, 40), 3, equal(test_val, 55), 4, equal(test_val, 60), 5, sqlNull()),\n      prop1: divide(if(equal([TEST_DB2]@join_1 > (OUTER) [TEST_DB2]@join_2 | toString([TEST_DB2]SOMETHING.something.toValue), '0903'), 0.0, [TEST_DB2]@join_3 > (INNER) [TEST_DB2]@join_4 | parseFloat([TEST_DB2]schema1.table2.col3)), if(isEmpty(factor), 1.0, divide(1, factor))),\n      part[part_TEST]: [TEST_SCOPE]@join_1 > @join_2\n    ),\n    prop1: divide(if(equal([TEST_DB2]@join_1 > (OUTER) [TEST_DB2]@join_2 | toString([TEST_DB2]SOMETHING.something.toValue), '0903'), 0.0, [TEST_DB2]@join_3 > (INNER) [TEST_DB2]@join_4 | parseFloat([TEST_DB2]schema1.table2.col3)), if(isEmpty(table.factor), 1.0, divide(1, table.factor)))\n  }\n)\n","kind":"roundtrip-unformatted","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.grammar.test.TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testRelationalMappingScope"}
{"source":"###Mapping\nMapping test::mapping\n(\n  EmbeddedCM[dummy]: Relational\n  {\n    something() Inline[TEST_Id],\n    prop1WithEmbedded\n    (\n      testProp2\n      (\n        size: 1,\n        testProp2\n        (\n          size: 1,\n          testProp2\n          (\n            size: 1\n          ),\n          size: 1\n        )\n      ),\n      contractId() Inline[TEST_Id],\n      something() Inline[TEST_Id],\n      prop6: EnumerationMapping testEnumerationMapping: 'SOME_CONSTANT',\n      prop3[id1]: [TEST_Store]@SOME_JOIN1 > [TEST_Store]@SOME_JOIN2,\n      prop4[id2]: [TEST_Store]@SOME_JOIN\n    ),\n    something() Inline[TEST_Id],\n    something() Inline[TEST_Id],\n    client\n    (\n      id: [DummyStore]test.RESULT.CLIENT_ID,\n      size: 1,\n      testProp2\n      (\n        size: 1\n      )\n    ) Otherwise ([part_TEST]: [DummyStore]@Testing)\n  }\n)\n","kind":"roundtrip","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.grammar.test.TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testEmbeddedRelationalMapping"}
{"source":"###Relational\nDatabase model::Test\n(\n  Table TestTable1\n  (\n    prop1_source INTEGER\n  )\n  Table TestTable2\n  (\n    prop2_source INTEGER\n  )\n\n  Join RandomJoin(TestTable1.prop1_source = TestTable2.prop2_source)\n)\n\n\n###Pure\nClass test::SomeClass\n{\n  prop: Integer[1];\n}\n\nAssociation test::SomeAssociation\n{\n  prop1: test::SomeClass[1];\n  prop2: test::SomeClass[1];\n}\n\n\n###Mapping\nMapping test::mapping\n(\n  test::SomeAssociation: Relational\n  {\n    AssociationMapping\n    (\n      prop1[prop2_source,prop1_source]: [model::Test]@RandomJoin,\n      prop2[prop1_source,prop2_source]: [model::Test]@RandomJoin\n    )\n  }\n)\n","kind":"roundtrip","origin":"org.finos.legend.engine.language.pure.grammar.test.TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testAssociationRelationalMapping"}
